# Same cell as -19b.play (a fresh pull rolls its own terrain/seed, so this is
# a new match, not a resumption): -19b got the mash tank to fightTime=278/300
# with the enemy cart at 88% stopped and 22s left, but the script ran out
# before a result screen. This run uses the same one-play-then-poll shape
# from the start, aiming to actually see WIN/DEFEAT on this map/spec/style
# for the first time today.
open
tap battleground
tap map:escort
tap class:druid:guardian
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15

play mash 100
wait 20
state
wait 20
state
wait 20
state
wait 20
state
wait 20
state
wait 20
state
wait 10
state
shot final
says
targets
